9244578:1:4","season":1,"episode":4,"title":"Los bocones hunden barcos","overview":"Mehmed lleva sus barcos al Cuerno de Oro hacia una gesta visionaria y atrevida. Ante la sombra de la traición, Giustiniani ataca la flota otomana.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mhXl8U8guilq8nBA5cMwJuYerKU.jpg","released":"2020-01-24T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"47 min"},{"id":"tt9244578:1:5","season":1,"episode":5,"title":"Antiguas profecías","overview":"En medio de una espiral de brutalidad y baja moral, Mehmed le hace una oferta tentadora a Giustiniani. El gran visir exhorta a Mehmed a llegar a una tregua con su rival.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kg31mt4y2kEkvOaSGFL7Y7C861A.jpg","released":"2020-01-24T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"46 min"},{"id":"tt9244578:1:6","season":1,"episode":6,"title":"Cenizas somos","overview":"Los cañones otomanos reducen los muros de la ciudad a simples ruinas, y los refuerzos llegan muy tarde. Mehmed marca el inicio de una nueva era para el Imperio otomano.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/stLMnfkX0JZq3UnNtcFMe4iWJMO.jpg","released":"2020-01-24T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"46 min"},{"id":"tt9244578:2:1","season":2,"episode":1,"title":"House Of War","overview":"Mehmed II solidifies his reign, but in nearby Wallachia, childhood friend Vlad the Impaler gains notoriety and seeks to challenge Mehmed's hegemony.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rMLL4xMk8tjZPRcUhHTmLpGXckM.jpg","released":"2022-12-29T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"50 min"},{"id":"tt9244578:2:2","season":2,"episode":2,"title":"Troubled Waters","overview":"Mehmed sends Maria to coax Hungarian King Matthias Corvinus into an alliance. An epic battle along the Danube River looms, and Vlad has the upper hand.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9mljTEKfQjGPPQZdXHTjuSGhhr3.jpg","released":"2022-12-29T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"42 min"},{"id":"tt9244578:2:3","season":2,"episode":3,"title":"Land Of Dracula","overview":"Mehmed's troops advance into Wallachia, and Vlad employs guerrilla tactics to weaken his rival. A threat lurks in the imperial palace.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/39FAHlFXZjVF8sZZFvgLSTE7s83.jpg","released":"2022-12-29T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"41 min"},{"id":"tt9244578:2:4","season":2,"episode":4,"title":"Brothers No More","overview":"4. Brothers No More\n\nAs the war drags on and resources dwindle, Vlad wages biological warfare on Mehmed's army. Radu closes in on Vlad's castle to take Anastasia hostage.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tUDGDOtZDFzG5w5765jaa8LWrpr.jpg","released":"2022-12-29T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"49 min"},{"id":"tt9244578:2:5","season":2,"episode":5,"title":"Night Attack","overview":"Mehmed prepares to strike a fatal blow to Vlad's army. A spy is found in Mehmed's camp. Vlad launches a nighttime attack, but a surprise awaits.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/c3Ow83kvruX8V2NxCLIXllUMFgW.jpg","released":"2022-12-29T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"48 min"},{"id":"tt9244578:2:6","season":2,"episode":6,"title":"Destiny","overview":"Vlad and Mehmed face off. Maria and Gülbahar foil the Wallachian plot. Ottoman troops march into an abandoned Târgoviște and face a gruesome sight.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tEw4os1NhICoWFQBKSvgeCdEzsK.jpg","released":"2022-12-29T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"50 min"}]}}